OL,3,AUK economy grew faster than expected in
OL,4,AJuly
OL,5,
OL,6,FExperts said July's growth figure
OL,7,Fshowed the UK economy was proving
OL,8,Fresilient in the face of shocks such as
OL,9,Fthe war in Iran, but said they expected
OL,10,Fgrowth to slow in the months ahead as
OL,11,Fhigh energy prices affect households.
